ldren":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"<div>Hello World</div>","collabId":"21326510-11bd-481d-8977-dd17c5cc91ec","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"b7c0f264-40f6-4c95-b9c7-8d95c8dc2f48","language":"html","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"a7096681-0e7c-492f-a713-7ceb6f7d6ab1"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"let text = div.firstChild;       // Text 节点是 div 的第一个子节点\ntext.appendData(\"!\");            // Hello World!\ntext.deleteData(0, 6);           // 从 0 开始，删除 6 个字符 ==> World!\ntext.insertData(0, \"Hello \");    // 在 0 前面插入文本， Hello_(_代表空格) => Hello World!\ntext.replaceData(0, 5, \"Hi\");    // 从 0 开始将后 5 个字符替换为 Hi => Hi World!\nlet newText = text.splitText(3); // 以 3 为界，分为两个文本节点 =>1. Hi_(_代表空格) 2. World!\nnewText.substringData(0, 1);     // W","collabId":"18dd24fd-5b06-4fdc-8577-2a6573be1b6f","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"7fbeba98-8263-438b-b216-24c05ee0e71d","language":"JavaScript","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"7cad828d-3b8e-4789-9c80-2e15e03974ca"}],"tags":["DOM"],"createTime":1690699144254,"updateTime":1793532520058,"linkedCards":[{"id":198,"target":{"key":"card:198","type":"card","id":198},"summary":"DOM 定义了一个 Node 类型的接口，DOM 树上的节点都实现了该类型，因此所有的节点都有着 Node 接口中规定的属性和方法。 虽然 HTML 元素以及文本内容都会被转化为节点，但是明显 document 节点，HTML 元素节点，以...","tags":["DOM"]}]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1793532520058}}